# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Byte-exact, no line-ending normalisation.
#
# This study measures whitespace: 1.78% of rows in the FlakeBench CSV contain
# CRLF, 11% contain tabs, and stage 01 asserts on those rates (see
# out/01_prep.json). Letting git rewrite CRLF -> LF on checkout would change
# the input data and quietly break reproduction of the central finding, which
# is that the two classes are separable by formatting alone.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
dataset/** -text
data/*.csv -text
data/*.json -text

*.npy binary
*.png binary
